  "vendor": "hubspot",
  "source_level": "official_template",
  "docs": "https://js.hs-analytics.net/analytics/1791543000000/53.js",
  "description": "Published browser SDK build1.4506 maps client, page, identity, privacy and event data to __ptq.gif, __ptbe.gif and __ptc.gif. Producer completeness and grammar checks are warnings. The loader is vendor/hubspot; tenant event configuration, remote acceptance and private runtime state remain outside this pack.",
